# Build context for crates/collector/Dockerfile. Ignore everything, then
# allow only what the workspace build needs.
**
!.cargo/
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!fuzz/Cargo.toml
!fuzz/fuzz_targets/
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
# shadow-rs reads the commit, branch and tag from these at build time. The
# index, logs and hooks change on every git command and stay out.
!.git/HEAD
!.git/packed-refs
!.git/refs/
!.git/objects/
# Local build output and generated files inside the allowed directories.
**/target/
**/kafka-yang-consumer-cache/
**/tests/trybuild/*.stderr
